      "value": "<p>Starting at 13th level, when you reduce a creature to 0 hit points or score a critical hit, you can choose one of the following effects for allies within 30 feet of you (your choice):</p><ul><li>Each ally gains temporary hit points equal to your Rogue level.</li><li>Each ally deals extra damage equal to your proficiency bonus on their next attack.</li><li>Each ally can immediately move up to 10 feet without provoking opportunity attacks.</li></ul>",
